9397", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300678_1311409961052730_5420981094237843162_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SS672FU5l98Q7kNvwE9Hzx_&_nc_oc=AdovCojdaDwFsVDyoPO4h9XQwR2mEY0qiPnQ_BcuWZO8nLsT1B_GfrmXbp6Yp6keOtE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af15X_SNKfs1YEHUr8c5lSvsdW08dgxdrt4lSjpVHt_cug&oe=69F0C151"}, {"file_name": "ss 2.png", "id": "925316027057675", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303679_925316030391008_8266001848879621098_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J3qiHATJ78IQ7kNvwE4Kzew&_nc_oc=AdqLqrQbK3lnBuL6TfC_eNgjzNZtA0-dN33JNuqJOzvRV-oklv7bT9H2dqthuHS-AaE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3oU95XxIG3gXiMrlIBv0G-3B1QHs-eYiUL-p2NQXhIwA&oe=69F0AA9C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Surah Ta-Ha", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience the recitation of Surah Ta-Ha, the twentieth chapter of the Holy Quran, in a deeply immersive virtual reality environment designed for Meta Quest.\n\nThis VR experience provides a calm and distraction-free setting where you can listen to and reflect on the verses of Surah Ta-Ha. The carefully designed virtual environment combined with high-quality audio helps create a peaceful atmosphere for concentration, reflection, and spiritual connection with the Quran.\n\nSurah Ta-Ha highlights the story of Prophet Musa (Moses) and his mission to guide Pharaoh and his people. The Surah emphasizes patience, faith, and trust in Allah while reminding believers of the importance of guidance, prayer, and humility.", "short_description": "Surah Ta-Ha highlights the story of Prophet Musa (Moses) and his mission to guide Pharaoh and his people. The Surah emphasizes patience, faith, and trust in Allah while reminding believers of the importance of guidance, prayer, and humility."}]}, "developer_name": "Miracle Group", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://miraclegroup.wo